{"id": "ncre-python-sample-q031:question:v1", "text": "全国计算机等级考试（NCRE）二级 Python 语言程序设计 样题及参考答案\n二、基本操作题 第31题\n知识标签：斐波那契数列、while、多重赋值、循环边界\n\n根据斐波那契数列的定义，F(0)=0，F(1)=1, F(n)=F(n-1)+F(n-2)(n>=2），输出不大于 100 的序\n列元素，请补充横线处的代码。\n\n```python\na, b = ____(1)____\nwhile ____(2)____:\n    print(a, end=' , ')\n    a, b = ____(3)____, ____(4)____\n```", "metadata": {"visibility": "question", "question_id": "ncre-python-sample-q031", "document_id": "31a16a56-e947-505e-948a-a7075fd42ea0", "document_type": "sample_exam", "document_sha256": "a0f6a19967464aba6bbb5150d4311311672179c963f631eeed6745e7f4956fd8", "source_path": "python考试真题/二级Python语言程序设计——样题及参考答案.pdf", "exam_year": null, "question_number": 31, "section": "二、基本操作题", "question_type": "code_blank", "pdf_pages": [7], "topic_tags": ["斐波那契数列", "while", "多重赋值", "循环边界"], "difficulty": 2, "annotation_origin": "project_annotation", "answer_available": false, "review_status": "draft", "retrieval_ready": true, "quality_flags": [], "runtime_curriculum_eligible": false, "asset_paths": ["assets/source-page-7.png"]}}
